* EE463 60 W sync buck - Step 4: input reverse-polarity protection (optional add-on 1) (LTspice netlist)
* Same circuit as 04_reverse_polarity.asc; names follow the KiCad schematic.
* Q3 (BSC030N08NS5) in the negative line: drain -> VIN- terminal, source -> circuit ground,
* gate -> VIN+ through R1 (100 k), D1 12 V Zener gate clamp. Converter = input capacitors + 60 W equivalent load (37 ohm).
.step param VIN list 48 -48 20 -20
V1    IN VIN_N {VIN} Rser=30m
MQ3   VIN_N Q3_G 0 0 BSC030N08NS5
R1    IN Q3_G 100k
D1    0 Q3_G BZT52C12
C2_12 IN 0 6u Rser=2m
C1    IN 0 82u Rser=18m
Rconv IN 0 37
.model BZT52C12 D(Is=1e-12 N=1 BV=12 IBV=5m Rs=5)
.model BSC030N08NS5 VDMOS(Rg=1.6 Rd=2.4m Rs=0.3m Vto=3.0 Kp=250 Lambda=0.01 Cgdmax=1.4n Cgdmin=40p A=0.5 Cgs=4n
+ Cjo=5n VJ=0.7 M=0.5 Is=1p N=1.05 Rb=1.5m TT=10n BV=80 mfg=Infineon Vds=80 Ron=3m)
.tran 0 3m 0 1u
.meas tran Iin   AVG -I(V1)     FROM 2.5m TO 3m
.meas tran Vgs   AVG V(Q3_G)    FROM 2.5m TO 3m
.meas tran Vds   AVG V(VIN_N)   FROM 2.5m TO 3m
.meas tran Vconv AVG V(IN)      FROM 2.5m TO 3m
.end
